  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The momentum values at t = 0, 1, 2, 3, and 4 s are 0, 20, 10, −10, and 20 kg·m·s⁻¹. During which interval is the magnitude of the net force greatest? A: 0–1 s, B: 1–2 s, C: 2–3 s, or D: 3–4 s?"
